{"3928510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Edge Of Evil", "steam_appid": 3928510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/b16a1b484c735b9204b0d8dc43d0f5af.avif?t=1788181378\" width=800 height=160 /></span>Your lost curious kitten has wandered into a dark, creepy, mysterious crypt... a tomb that belongs to a coven of pirates, where through their mortal years they have amassed a huge bounty of jewels, gems and ancient coins. Now centuries later, and long since dead, they lay buried with their treasure. But understanding the nature of thieves and determined to keep their loot, even in death, they have summoned the spirits of the &quot;shadow world&quot; to govern and protect this crypt from the very bandits they once were.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Yeah... yeah... Pirates, treasure, kittens... blah... blah... but what is the actual gameplay like?</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Explore hidden passages carved deep beneath the crypt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Uncover dark secrets buried beyond the graves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Open ancient coffins and disturb what should remain dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Challenge the dead to games of chance and solve cryptic puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Dig through forgotten tombs in search of clues and treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Shoot undead shadow servants before they drag you into the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Rescue your lost kitten from the nightmare below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/2e8c9b8986600152ded263011abeb923.poster.avif?t=1788181378\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/2e8c9b8986600152ded263011abeb923.webm?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/2e8c9b8986600152ded263011abeb923.mp4?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/129a8efebc96ca907c2921ffddadb1a6.poster.avif?t=1788181378\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/129a8efebc96ca907c2921ffddadb1a6.webm?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/129a8efebc96ca907c2921ffddadb1a6.mp4?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/d54910f1fbfafee4e8977f5d40e6a4b6.poster.avif?t=1788181378\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/d54910f1fbfafee4e8977f5d40e6a4b6.webm?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/d54910f1fbfafee4e8977f5d40e6a4b6.mp4?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9b59632e69fd53f63051202e2de91064.poster.avif?t=1788181378\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9b59632e69fd53f63051202e2de91064.webm?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9b59632e69fd53f63051202e2de91064.mp4?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9eedf836cf248591fd176ea105bb7ea0.poster.avif?t=1788181378\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9eedf836cf248591fd176ea105bb7ea0.webm?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9eedf836cf248591fd176ea105bb7ea0.mp4?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/0ca7a9b3c8898d0d8cc5afa031819d31.poster.avif?t=1788181378\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/0ca7a9b3c8898d0d8cc5afa031819d31.webm?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/0ca7a9b3c8898d0d8cc5afa031819d31.mp4?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i> </i>     <br><strong>Beneath the crypt</strong> lies a fortune so vast that generations of miners carved an elaborate mine cart network into the depths, determined to haul its endless gold to the surface. But greed drove them deeper than wisdom ever should have allowed. The restless spirits guarding these riches were far from dormant, and the tunnels soon became their hunting grounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now the abandoned carts still race through the darkness, plunging across crumbling tracks, forgotten chambers, and bottomless chasms. Keep your wits about you—one missed track switch could send you hurtling off the rails and into the blackest depths of the underworld, where countless miners met their doom and never returned.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/b0c85da87d47b44dbebf640fa87912fd.poster.avif?t=1788181378\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/b0c85da87d47b44dbebf640fa87912fd.webm?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/b0c85da87d47b44dbebf640fa87912fd.mp4?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Edge of Evil</strong> is a horror experience that will take you deep below, through dark twisted passages and into the depths of a long forgotten locked crypt in search of answers to an ancient seal that has been broken, unleashing a powerful presence from the mysterious <strong><i>&quot;Black World&quot;</i></strong>      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/bee0fe02a5d5c8227c5bfe9d15469152.poster.avif?t=1788181378\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/bee0fe02a5d5c8227c5bfe9d15469152.webm?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/bee0fe02a5d5c8227c5bfe9d15469152.mp4?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>A TrulyHaunting Experience:</strong> Realistic graphics and immersive sounds as well as a minimal user interface ensure a totally visceral horror experience; forcing you to continuously question your own senses... just beyond, and right up to the <strong><i>edge.</i></strong>..  <br><br> - Fully Voice Acted<br>- 4-5 Hours of Gameplay<br>- Realistic Graphics         <br>- Immersive Sound And Music        <br>- Eerie Ambience And Atmosphere        <br>- Intriguing Mystery To Solve <br>- Interesting Characters <br><br><br><strong>WHAT MAKES EDGE OF EVIL DIFFERENT?</strong><br><br>A rare blend of pirate horror and occult fantasy where the story is a bit more intimate... The player is not a soldier or chosen hero — just someone pulled into evil through loss, curiosity, and emotional attachment, not just survival. The search for a lost kitten creates emotional vulnerability that makes every discovery feel more disturbing.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/0217d9ec3f58cb313c702a6cef0a440a.poster.avif?t=1788181378\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/0217d9ec3f58cb313c702a6cef0a440a.webm?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Does digging up graves sound like fun?  You would be surprised what you can find buried in this crypt... treasure, secret passages and a dark hidden past. But don't dig too deep or you might uncover something that probably should stay buried. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/89625a4739f224862de10e10f1d87011.poster.avif?t=1788181378\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/89625a4739f224862de10e10f1d87011.webm?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/89625a4739f224862de10e10f1d87011.mp4?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/f18408b0e956cf1be386528de696b6eb.avif?t=1788181378\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/236a3a96820688ab630a017d2d20d45b.avif?t=1788181378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras_big/236a3a96820688ab630a017d2d20d45b.avif?t=1788181378 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/326e239fc3e1ff04083c286b54555a48.poster.avif?t=1788181378\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/326e239fc3e1ff04083c286b54555a48.webm?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/326e239fc3e1ff04083c286b54555a48.mp4?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ <br>Here's what a few YouTubers and Streamers are saying about the demo... <br>------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ <br><strong><i>&quot;Wow! Amazing demo! Very scary...very creepy. I liked the ambience... it messes with your head from the very beginning.&quot;</i></strong>-RadicalFoil1796<br><br>&quot;<i><strong>10/10 Banger of a game! Can't wait for the full release.&quot;</strong></i> - Chrispymate <br><br><i><strong>&quot;Visually, atmospherically, and gameplay-wise, absolutely well done!&quot;</strong></i> - cowzilla75<br><br>&quot;<i><strong>This was an awesome horror game demo! I really enjoyed the whole thing, the graphics were great, the sound effects awesome and the unfolding story interesting.&quot;</strong></i> - Bobe-wan<br><br><strong><i>Can't wait for the Full Release. WE WILL BE THERE.</i></strong> - zbidon<br><br>&quot;<strong><i>A perfect mix of ambience, horror and puzzles. The attention to detail, the voice acting, the graphics. Just an awesome horror game. I can't wait to play the full game!&quot;</i></strong> - Damyan<br><br><i><strong>&quot;Very cool atmosphere with great voice acting. the sounds were scary and the graphics were surreal. I need to know what happens in the full game, can't wait&quot;</strong></i> - AlakiBuffs<br><br><strong><i>&quot;Loved the graphics, puzzle, kitty cat and the purple glow!! Looking forward to the full game&quot;</i></strong> - SarahsScaries<br><br><i><strong>&quot;Stellar graphics, story, plot, etc.&quot;</strong></i> - TisticDemon<br><br>&quot;<i><strong>Game looks great and gameplay is good!&quot;</strong></i> - EvaPilot03<br><br><strong><i>&quot;Very, very good! I really enjoyed this game... I am wishlisting this right now. I need this in my life!&quot;</i></strong> - ReAnimateHer  <br><br>&quot;<strong><i>That was cool... creepy and mysterious demo. I enjoy that!&quot;</i></strong> -Lady Boomin<br><br><strong><i>&quot;I am looking forward to playing this when the full version comes out. We will 100% play this when it comes out.&quot;</i></strong> - Dr. Ravenholm<br><br><strong><i>&quot;This really surprised me... It has way more quality than I expected. The ambience is amazing!&quot;</i></strong> -Damyan<br><br><strong><i>&quot;I wanted to play some more!&quot;</i></strong> -Duffin<br><br><strong><i>&quot;I thought this was fun... I might have to pick this up and save the kitty!&quot;</i></strong> -LonePC<br><br><i><strong>&quot;Wow! I'm intrigued. Looking forward to the full game release!&quot;</strong></i> -AlakiBuffs<br><br><strong><i>&quot;So Fire! Lets go! What a cool demo!&quot;</i></strong> -Dracul</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&gt;&gt;&gt; <strong><i>STOP READING this and get in there and help find &quot;Lil Nightshade&quot;</i></strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/b16a1b484c735b9204b0d8dc43d0f5af.avif?t=1788181378\" width=800 height=160 /></span>Your lost curious kitten has wandered into a dark, creepy, mysterious crypt... a tomb that belongs to a coven of pirates, where through their mortal years they have amassed a huge bounty of jewels, gems and ancient coins. Now centuries later, and long since dead, they lay buried with their treasure. But understanding the nature of thieves and determined to keep their loot, even in death, they have summoned the spirits of the &quot;shadow world&quot; to govern and protect this crypt from the very bandits they once were.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Yeah... yeah... Pirates, treasure, kittens... blah... blah... but what is the actual gameplay like?</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Explore hidden passages carved deep beneath the crypt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Uncover dark secrets buried beyond the graves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Open ancient coffins and disturb what should remain dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Challenge the dead to games of chance and solve cryptic puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Dig through forgotten tombs in search of clues and treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Shoot undead shadow servants before they drag you into the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Rescue your lost kitten from the nightmare below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/2e8c9b8986600152ded263011abeb923.poster.avif?t=1788181378\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/2e8c9b8986600152ded263011abeb923.webm?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/2e8c9b8986600152ded263011abeb923.mp4?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/129a8efebc96ca907c2921ffddadb1a6.poster.avif?t=1788181378\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/129a8efebc96ca907c2921ffddadb1a6.webm?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/129a8efebc96ca907c2921ffddadb1a6.mp4?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/d54910f1fbfafee4e8977f5d40e6a4b6.poster.avif?t=1788181378\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/d54910f1fbfafee4e8977f5d40e6a4b6.webm?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/d54910f1fbfafee4e8977f5d40e6a4b6.mp4?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9b59632e69fd53f63051202e2de91064.poster.avif?t=1788181378\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9b59632e69fd53f63051202e2de91064.webm?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9b59632e69fd53f63051202e2de91064.mp4?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9eedf836cf248591fd176ea105bb7ea0.poster.avif?t=1788181378\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9eedf836cf248591fd176ea105bb7ea0.webm?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9eedf836cf248591fd176ea105bb7ea0.mp4?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/0ca7a9b3c8898d0d8cc5afa031819d31.poster.avif?t=1788181378\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/0ca7a9b3c8898d0d8cc5afa031819d31.webm?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/0ca7a9b3c8898d0d8cc5afa031819d31.mp4?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i> </i>     <br><strong>Beneath the crypt</strong> lies a fortune so vast that generations of miners carved an elaborate mine cart network into the depths, determined to haul its endless gold to the surface. But greed drove them deeper than wisdom ever should have allowed. The restless spirits guarding these riches were far from dormant, and the tunnels soon became their hunting grounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now the abandoned carts still race through the darkness, plunging across crumbling tracks, forgotten chambers, and bottomless chasms. Keep your wits about you—one missed track switch could send you hurtling off the rails and into the blackest depths of the underworld, where countless miners met their doom and never returned.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/b0c85da87d47b44dbebf640fa87912fd.poster.avif?t=1788181378\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/b0c85da87d47b44dbebf640fa87912fd.webm?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/b0c85da87d47b44dbebf640fa87912fd.mp4?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Edge of Evil</strong> is a horror experience that will take you deep below, through dark twisted passages and into the depths of a long forgotten locked crypt in search of answers to an ancient seal that has been broken, unleashing a powerful presence from the mysterious <strong><i>&quot;Black World&quot;</i></strong>      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/bee0fe02a5d5c8227c5bfe9d15469152.poster.avif?t=1788181378\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/bee0fe02a5d5c8227c5bfe9d15469152.webm?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/bee0fe02a5d5c8227c5bfe9d15469152.mp4?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>A TrulyHaunting Experience:</strong> Realistic graphics and immersive sounds as well as a minimal user interface ensure a totally visceral horror experience; forcing you to continuously question your own senses... just beyond, and right up to the <strong><i>edge.</i></strong>..  <br><br> - Fully Voice Acted<br>- 4-5 Hours of Gameplay<br>- Realistic Graphics         <br>- Immersive Sound And Music        <br>- Eerie Ambience And Atmosphere        <br>- Intriguing Mystery To Solve <br>- Interesting Characters <br><br><br><strong>WHAT MAKES EDGE OF EVIL DIFFERENT?</strong><br><br>A rare blend of pirate horror and occult fantasy where the story is a bit more intimate... The player is not a soldier or chosen hero — just someone pulled into evil through loss, curiosity, and emotional attachment, not just survival. The search for a lost kitten creates emotional vulnerability that makes every discovery feel more disturbing.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/0217d9ec3f58cb313c702a6cef0a440a.poster.avif?t=1788181378\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/0217d9ec3f58cb313c702a6cef0a440a.webm?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Does digging up graves sound like fun?  You would be surprised what you can find buried in this crypt... treasure, secret passages and a dark hidden past. But don't dig too deep or you might uncover something that probably should stay buried. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/89625a4739f224862de10e10f1d87011.poster.avif?t=1788181378\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/89625a4739f224862de10e10f1d87011.webm?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/89625a4739f224862de10e10f1d87011.mp4?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/f18408b0e956cf1be386528de696b6eb.avif?t=1788181378\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/236a3a96820688ab630a017d2d20d45b.avif?t=1788181378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras_big/236a3a96820688ab630a017d2d20d45b.avif?t=1788181378 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/326e239fc3e1ff04083c286b54555a48.poster.avif?t=1788181378\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/326e239fc3e1ff04083c286b54555a48.webm?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/326e239fc3e1ff04083c286b54555a48.mp4?t=1788181378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ <br>Here's what a few YouTubers and Streamers are saying about the demo... <br>------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ <br><strong><i>&quot;Wow! Amazing demo! Very scary...very creepy. I liked the ambience... it messes with your head from the very beginning.&quot;</i></strong>-RadicalFoil1796<br><br>&quot;<i><strong>10/10 Banger of a game! Can't wait for the full release.&quot;</strong></i> - Chrispymate <br><br><i><strong>&quot;Visually, atmospherically, and gameplay-wise, absolutely well done!&quot;</strong></i> - cowzilla75<br><br>&quot;<i><strong>This was an awesome horror game demo! I really enjoyed the whole thing, the graphics were great, the sound effects awesome and the unfolding story interesting.&quot;</strong></i> - Bobe-wan<br><br><strong><i>Can't wait for the Full Release. WE WILL BE THERE.</i></strong> - zbidon<br><br>&quot;<strong><i>A perfect mix of ambience, horror and puzzles. The attention to detail, the voice acting, the graphics. Just an awesome horror game. I can't wait to play the full game!&quot;</i></strong> - Damyan<br><br><i><strong>&quot;Very cool atmosphere with great voice acting. the sounds were scary and the graphics were surreal. I need to know what happens in the full game, can't wait&quot;</strong></i> - AlakiBuffs<br><br><strong><i>&quot;Loved the graphics, puzzle, kitty cat and the purple glow!! Looking forward to the full game&quot;</i></strong> - SarahsScaries<br><br><i><strong>&quot;Stellar graphics, story, plot, etc.&quot;</strong></i> - TisticDemon<br><br>&quot;<i><strong>Game looks great and gameplay is good!&quot;</strong></i> - EvaPilot03<br><br><strong><i>&quot;Very, very good! I really enjoyed this game... I am wishlisting this right now. I need this in my life!&quot;</i></strong> - ReAnimateHer  <br><br>&quot;<strong><i>That was cool... creepy and mysterious demo. I enjoy that!&quot;</i></strong> -Lady Boomin<br><br><strong><i>&quot;I am looking forward to playing this when the full version comes out. We will 100% play this when it comes out.&quot;</i></strong> - Dr. Ravenholm<br><br><strong><i>&quot;This really surprised me... It has way more quality than I expected. The ambience is amazing!&quot;</i></strong> -Damyan<br><br><strong><i>&quot;I wanted to play some more!&quot;</i></strong> -Duffin<br><br><strong><i>&quot;I thought this was fun... I might have to pick this up and save the kitty!&quot;</i></strong> -LonePC<br><br><i><strong>&quot;Wow! I'm intrigued. Looking forward to the full game release!&quot;</strong></i> -AlakiBuffs<br><br><strong><i>&quot;So Fire! Lets go! What a cool demo!&quot;</i></strong> -Dracul</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&gt;&gt;&gt; <strong><i>STOP READING this and get in there and help find &quot;Lil Nightshade&quot;</i></strong></h2>", "short_description": "Descend into terror in this first-person psychological horror experience as you follow your lost kitten into an ancient pirate crypt. Explore, shoot and dig for clues…literally, while unravelling a chilling mystery, all in a desperate bid to rescue your helplessly curious pet from this dark tomb.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/59cdc55f04c4af66f17f9474f10dadeb5f813265/header.jpg?t=1788181378", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/5ba393bef85474f1ff9b6cae51ee02e5d3325f63/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788181378", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/5ba393bef85474f1ff9b6cae51ee02e5d3325f63/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788181378", "website": "http://wrfstudios.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</stron